{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98861","id":2163800883,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6A-Psz","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98861","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98861.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98861.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98861","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98861/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98861/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98861/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/01a2726c5919a64d012123003f2569e25750708a","number":98861,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Get joypad's vendor ID, product ID and name on Windows for XInput devices.","user":{"login":"MJacred","id":6639237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzkyMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6639237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred","html_url":"https://github.com/MJacred","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently, XInput devices (Windows only) lack info on vendor, product and its name. DirectInput also does not provide vendor and product. This PR is to fix that.\r\n\r\nTODO\r\n* [x] vendor ID (both)\r\n* [x] product ID (both)\r\n* [x] name (XInput only)\r\n\r\nNOTES\r\n* Previously, all XInput joypads had the name `XInput Gamepad`, now they have proper names\r\n* I'm stripping \"Controller (…)\" from the name. Also for DirectInput devices. There's no reason for keeping this redundancy.\r\n\r\nIdeas for alternative implementation\r\n* using `joyGetDevCapsW`, therefore loading Winmm.dll\r\n  * I haven't tested it, but it should also be possible to get product and vendor ID using `GetRawInputDeviceInfoA` or `DIDEVICEINSTANCE`, basically making loading Winmm.dll obsolete. If I should check it out, I will. I'm not doing that right now, because I'm lacking background logic of the whole device mess (these APIs are all deprecated anyway...)\r\n* I also could have generated a guid, as the DirectInput code does, but I cannot verify if they are correct…\r\n  * `sprintf_s(uid, \"%04x%04x%04x%04x%04x%04x%04x%04x\", BSWAP16(0x03), 0, jc.wMid, 0, jc.wPid, 0, 0, 0);` generated `03000000045e0000028e000000000000` and `03000000046d0000c21f000000000000`\r\n\r\nTestproject for this PR:  \r\n[xinput_info.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18142511/xinput_info.zip)\r\n\r\n\r\noutput of Testproject on Windows\r\n![finally](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac45c382-13ab-4ca0-8115-7a4959b3a688)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://a